{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2013-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1379894400, "end_date": 1380585599, "month_true_total": 239, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:01:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1420561", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993087593", "personaname": "licensed mango", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mango_rat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 82, "playtime_forever": 13526, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2438, "last_played": 1731147150, "avatar": "17a00fa052400bd4b8f2d5bf5ac0622b05f485bc"}, "language": "english", "review": "the third installment of\nfire\ncease fire\nfire\ncease fire\nfire\ncease fire\nfire\ncease fire", "timestamp_created": 1380576333, "timestamp_updated": 1385507638, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.559514939785003662", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5390467", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048995566", "personaname": "Jonpas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jonpas/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 257514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80789, "last_played": 1788353339, "avatar": "d14ca1bc896f31c16590ec7660ad1860ce03998e"}, "language": "english", "review": "An open military sandbox which allows for pretty much anything anyone would ever like to do, be it a military or a completely different aspect such as RPG game modes. I wouldn't consider Arma a game at all, but a tool. A tool to play with, to experiment with (for science), and badly break.\n\nEven though there is much love-hate relationship between the modders and the studio behind the game, it allows for vast modding capabilities which range from different smaller enhancements, new assets, all the way to realistic ballistics, medical systems to complete conversions featuring all listed combined.\n\nSingleplayer is so-so, not the best, not the worst. Where Arma really shines is multiplayer, let it be Cooperative or Adversarial (PvP), especially with a group of people that want the same experience from the sandbox Arma is.\n\nArma lets you choose how you want to play it, be it RPG experience or relaxed tactical shooter or full-on realism or anything in-between. Community behind it developed and is developing an immense array of missions and mods, which you can use in any combination to get the experience you want.", "timestamp_created": 1380571240, "timestamp_updated": 1435066930, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527874469757080078", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "989199", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983792067", "personaname": "Vanoi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Vanoi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6259, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1069, "last_played": 1608007014, "avatar": "1cccfb1861e451658d7de5b687562708b7542f56"}, "language": "english", "review": "Needs more crashing.", "timestamp_created": 1380568823, "timestamp_updated": 1380568823, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "265534", "author": {"steamid": "76561197967077661", "personaname": "Arrowhead"